# The Horde Rogue level 10 quests, each ending with the Blade of Cunning
# (7298), a dagger:
# - Orcs and Trolls: The Shattered Hand (1963, 1858) from Therzok in
#   Orgrimmar's Cleft of Shadow. Orcs are sent to him by Kaplak in Razor Hill
#   (Therzok, 1859); Trolls take 1963 from Therzok directly.
# - Undead: Mennet Carkad and The Deathstalkers (1885, 1886, 1898, 1899,
#   1978), from Marion Call in Brill to the Undercity, Silverpine Forest and
#   back.
# Therzok (1859) and Mennet Carkad (1885) shut each other out (quests.json
# `excl`): one chain per character.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers,
# drops and places; travel.json for the inns (Gamon and Marion Call stand by
# the innkeepers); Forever's Rogue class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes (none for these chains). Tazan's Key has one source in
# the data, Gamon in Orgrimmar (Pick Pocket; it drops on a kill almost never);
# the quest asks you to steal it.
# data/local/mechanics (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20):
# Tazan's hill path and 4 1/2 minute respawn, the satchel handed in unopened,
# one satchel per kill; Astor Hadren's two dialogue options; Andron's
# bookshelf in the back room; the way to Varimathras.
# Opening Tazan's Satchel with Pick Lock instead of the key: a Forever
# leveling guide from 2026 does it once Pick Lock is trained.
# Horde Skyborne have no level 10 Rogue quest in the data.
# The leveling guides leave these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orcs and Trolls

step Therzok
  only Orc
  tip At 10 Kaplak, the rogue trainer in Razor Hill, sends you to Therzok in Orgrimmar. It is only a pointer: an Orc already in Orgrimmar can skip it and take The Shattered Hand from Therzok straight away.
  level 10
  accept 1859                                 -- Kaplak

step The Shattered Hand
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Therzok stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Trolls: take The Shattered Hand from him at 10.
  level 10
  turnin 1859 only Orc                        -- Therzok
  accept 1963

step Tazan
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  tip Tazan (level 13, not elite) is a troll pirate on the Merchant Coast south of Ratchet: he walks the fenced hill path between the lower pirate camp by the beached ship and the upper camp by a big tree. Fight him at the foot of the hill, away from the camps. He always drops his satchel and is back 4 1/2 minutes after a death; one satchel per kill, so two rogues need two kills. Hand the satchel in unopened: picking its lock now destroys it and you must kill him again.
  collect 7209 quest 1963.1                   -- Tazan's Satchel: Tazan

step Back to Therzok
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 1963                                 -- Therzok, Cleft of Shadow
  accept 1858

step Tazan's Key
  only Orc,Troll
  tip Therzok hands the satchel back: now open it. Gamon (level 12) kneels by the innkeeper in the inn in the Valley of Strength; stealth up and pick his pocket for Tazan's Key (do not kill him: the key almost never drops). Players often kill him, so you may wait up to 5 minutes for him. Then use the key on Tazan's Satchel in your bags. If you have trained Pick Lock, you can pick the satchel's lock instead.
  collect 7208 x1                             -- Tazan's Key: Pick Pocket Gamon
  use 7209 quest 1858.1 @54.0,68.0            -- Tazan's Satchel, once you have the key
  collect 7295 quest 1858.1 @54.0,68.0        -- Tazan's Logbook, from the satchel

step Therzok's reward
  only Orc,Troll
  turnin 1858 reward 7298                     -- Therzok, Cleft of Shadow

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undead

step Mennet Carkad
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip At 10 Marion Call, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Gallows' End Tavern in Brill, sends you to Mennet Carkad in the Undercity.
  level 10
  accept 1885                                 -- Marion Call

step The Rogues' Quarter
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip Mennet Carkad stands in the Rogues' Quarter.
  turnin 1885                                 -- Mennet Carkad
  accept 1886

step Astor Hadren
  only Undead
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Astor Hadren (level 13) walks the road between the Sepulcher and the Undercity, north of the Sepulcher. He looks like a friendly traveller with no quest mark. Talk to him and pick both of his answers: he turns hostile. Kill him for the letter (it always drops). Fight him away from guards, who can take the kill and leave no loot; only one rogue per kill gets the letter. He is back 5 minutes after a death.
  collect 7231 quest 1886.1                   -- Astor's Letter of Introduction: Astor Hadren

step Back to Mennet Carkad
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1886                                 -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
  accept 1898

step Andron Gant
  only Undead
  tip Andron Gant is in the Apothecarium, in its biggest room, where two huge guards watch a small bridge. His ledger is on the bookshelf in the back room behind him, not the shelf on the wall next to him.
  turnin 1898                                 -- Andron Gant
  accept 1899
  collect 7294 quest 1899.1                   -- Andron's Ledger: Andron's Bookshelf

step Mennet and Varimathras
  only Undead
  tip Mennet sends the ledger on to Varimathras, the big demon in the middle of the Hall of the Dark Lady in the Royal Quarter, past its elite guards; the way in is the passage off the Apothecarium. If you lose the ledger, take another from Andron's bookshelf.
  turnin 1899                                 -- Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter
  accept 1978
  turnin 1978 reward 7298                     -- Varimathras, Royal Quarter
